; Derived exclusively from the official Microsoft CE
; documentation pages: each name below appears on the
; listed page whose Requirements row names this link
; library (wince-docs-corpus).  No shared-source/
; device-dump/VS/PB-derived name is used.  Ordinals are
; not published; entries are name-only.
; LIBRARY tag = documented Link Library row (Ceutil.lib); the on-device
; module name is not published by the CE documentation.
;
; Pages: CeGetDeviceId (ee487274); CeGetDeviceId (ms861107); CeGetSelectedDeviceId (aa513363); CeGetSelectedDeviceId (ee484552)
LIBRARY ceutil.lib
EXPORTS
  CeGetDeviceId
  CeGetSelectedDeviceId
